及物品等等，需要准确的描述出来；场景中各种出现的各类服装、物品材质和纹理细节（如：【颜色（含渐变/纹理色）】【形状（含轮廓/结构细节）】【材质（如金属光泽/布艺纹理/玻璃通透感）】等等）\n   - 空间层次维度：清晰区分【前景】（画面最前端元素，如地面纹理/近处小物件）、【中景】（核心主体所在区域）、【背景】（主体后方元素，如建筑/植被/天空），并描述各层次元素的相对位置关系；\n   - 构图与视觉引导维度：明确画面布局（如居中构图/三分法构图/对角线构图）、视觉引导线（如道路延伸线/建筑轮廓线）、景别（如特写/近景/中景/远景/全景）；拍摄角度（如俯拍，仰拍等）\n   - 光影氛围维度：明确光线类型（如自然光/柔光箱打光/侧逆光/顶光）、阴影效果（如硬阴影/软阴影/投影方向/阴影浓度）、整体氛围（如清新明亮/复古怀旧/暗黑悬疑/温馨治愈）；\n  \n三、禁止要求：\n   - 禁止描述人物的人种；\n   - 禁止描述图像水印、公司logo；\n   - 禁止加入图像中未出现的虚构元素（含场景、物件、文字）；\n   - 禁止使用笼统模糊表述；\n   - 禁止出现无关文字、符号或总结性语句。\n四、文字输出\n- 控制在400字以内。", 2048, true, 224501280747114, "fixed", "auto"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 20301, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": true}, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#374539", "size": [339